<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 598.8 mln reais net inflow Jan 1-20.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 598.8 mln reais net inflow Jan 1-20.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it registered foreign capital inflows of 598.8 million reais in the first 20 days of January.</p>
<p>Foreign buys amounted to 2.999 billion reais, against foreign sales of 2.400 billion reais.</p>
<p>Last year, foreign capital inflows totalled 3.379 billion reais.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511-2485412</p>
